                ['What makes this different from the business management doctorate?', '<p>The taught year. Where the business doctorate spreads across management, human resources and strategy, this one gives you four marketing courses: advanced theory, consumer behaviour, integrated marketing communications and current issues in the field. Your seminar is a marketing seminar, and your supervision sits with the Business and Economics Faculty.</p>', 1],
