                ['What English evidence will I need?', '<p>GAU exempts applicants from its Foundation English School programme on certificates including IELTS, TOEFL, PTE, SAT and Cambridge qualifications, with a higher threshold applied to postgraduate students. Documents must reach Student Services before you sit the proficiency examination, because certificates are not accepted afterwards. Confirm the doctoral threshold with the Institute, since the published table names master\'s students rather than PhD candidates.</p>', 4],
